      it: "FitMesh Sync legge qualsiasi smartwatch Wear OS (Pixel Watch, OnePlus Watch, TicWatch, Mobvoi, Fossil Gen 6) via Health Connect. I dati passano prima dall'app companion del produttore (Google Health per Pixel Watch, l'app dedicata per gli altri brand), che li scrive su Health Connect: FitMesh li legge da li.",
      en: "FitMesh Sync reads any Wear OS smartwatch (Pixel Watch, OnePlus Watch, TicWatch, Mobvoi, Fossil Gen 6) via Health Connect. Data first passes through the manufacturer's companion app (Google Health for Pixel Watch, the dedicated app for other brands), which writes it to Health Connect: FitMesh reads it from there.",
      es: "FitMesh Sync lee cualquier smartwatch Wear OS (Pixel Watch, OnePlus Watch, TicWatch, Mobvoi, Fossil Gen 6) a través de Health Connect. Los datos pasan primero por la app complementaria del fabricante (Google Health para Pixel Watch, la app dedicada para otras marcas), que los escribe en Health Connect: FitMesh los lee desde ahí.",
      de: "FitMesh Sync liest Daten von jeder Wear OS Smartwatch (Pixel Watch, OnePlus Watch, TicWatch, Mobvoi, Fossil Gen 6) über Health Connect. Die Daten durchlaufen zuerst die Companion-App des Herstellers (Google Health für die Pixel Watch, die jeweilige App für andere Marken), die sie in Health Connect schreibt: von dort liest FitMesh sie aus.",
      pt: "O FitMesh Sync lê qualquer smartwatch Wear OS (Pixel Watch, OnePlus Watch, TicWatch, Mobvoi, Fossil Gen 6) via Health Connect. Os dados passam primeiro pelo aplicativo complementar do fabricante (Google Health para o Pixel Watch, o app dedicado para as outras marcas), que os grava no Health Connect: o FitMesh os lê a partir de lá.",
      fr: "FitMesh Sync lit n'importe quelle montre connectée Wear OS (Pixel Watch, OnePlus Watch, TicWatch, Mobvoi, Fossil Gen 6) via Health Connect. Les données passent d'abord par l'application compagnon du fabricant (Google Health pour la Pixel Watch, l'application dédiée pour les autres marques), qui les écrit dans Health Connect: FitMesh les y lit.",
      pl: "FitMesh Sync odczytuje dane z dowolnego smartwatcha Wear OS (Pixel Watch, OnePlus Watch, TicWatch, Mobvoi, Fossil Gen 6) przez Health Connect. Dane najpierw przechodzą przez aplikację towarzyszącą producenta (Google Health dla Pixel Watch, dedykowana aplikacja dla innych marek), która zapisuje je w Health Connect: FitMesh odczytuje je stamtąd.",
      tr: "FitMesh Sync, Health Connect üzerinden herhangi bir Wear OS akıllı saatini (Pixel Watch, OnePlus Watch, TicWatch, Mobvoi, Fossil Gen 6) okur. Veriler önce üreticinin yardımcı uygulamasından geçer (Pixel Watch için Google Health, diğer markalar için kendi özel uygulamaları); bu uygulama verileri Health Connect'e yazar ve FitMesh onları oradan okur.",
      nl: "FitMesh Sync leest elke Wear OS-smartwatch uit (Pixel Watch, OnePlus Watch, TicWatch, Mobvoi, Fossil Gen 6) via Health Connect. Gegevens gaan eerst via de companion-app van de fabrikant (Google Health voor Pixel Watch, de eigen app voor andere merken), die ze naar Health Connect schrijft: FitMesh leest ze vandaar uit.",
      ja: "FitMesh Syncは、Health Connect経由であらゆるWear OSスマートウォッチ(Pixel Watch、OnePlus Watch、TicWatch、Mobvoi、Fossil Gen 6)のデータを読み取ります。データはまずメーカーの純正アプリ(Pixel WatchはGoogle Health、他のブランドは専用アプリ)を経由し、そこからHealth Connectに書き込まれます。FitMeshはそこからデータを読み取ります。",
      ko: "FitMesh Sync는 Health Connect를 통해 모든 Wear OS 스마트워치(Pixel Watch, OnePlus Watch, TicWatch, Mobvoi, Fossil Gen 6)의 데이터를 읽습니다. 데이터는 먼저 제조사의 컴패니언 앱(Pixel Watch의 경우 Google Health, 다른 브랜드는 전용 앱)을 거쳐 Health Connect에 기록되고, FitMesh는 이를 그곳에서 읽어옵니다.",
